{"id":"book-f2be0e13-c684-47e5-bc19-ba6b62fae963","slug":"Willows-Big-Forest-Adventure","title":"Willow’s Big \nForest Adventure","tagline":"A little tiger. A very big roar. \nAnd the happiest hug of all.","author":"Wernard Broodryk","date":"19 Sept 2026","cover":"Willow - Tiger.webp","pdf":"Willows-Big-Forest-Adventure-2.pdf","pages":[{"id":"page-1","sourcePage":1,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Willow’s Big\n\nForest Adventure\n\nA little tiger. A very big\n\nroar. And the happiest\n\nhug of all.\n\n01 / 10"],"imageAsset":"art-001.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-001.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-001.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-001.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"top","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-1-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":50,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-001.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-001.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-1-text","type":"text","x":56,"y":18,"w":38,"h":64,"z":2,"text":"Willow’s Big\n\nForest Adventure\n\nA little tiger. A very big\n\nroar. And the happiest\n\nhug of all.\n\n01 / 10","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""},{"id":"page-2","sourcePage":2,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["One sunny day, Willow was strolling through the forest with her Mummy and Mamma.\n\nWillow spotted a butterfly dancing\nbetween the trees.\n\n“Wait for me!” she giggled, and she ran after the beautiful butterfly."],"imageAsset":"art-002.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-002.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-002.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-002.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"top","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-2-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":49.06543145137796,"h":99.58414208074535,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-002.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-002.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-2-text","type":"text","x":55.22846284018845,"y":10.57180105853051,"w":40.98737179037873,"h":76.92954156288917,"z":2,"text":"One sunny day, Willow was strolling through the forest with her Mummy and Mamma.\n\nWillow spotted a butterfly dancing\nbetween the trees.\n\n“Wait for me!” she giggled, and she ran after the beautiful butterfly.","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"},{"id":"el-6fa5eb62-c4e5-49cd-b6a0-ef8e7e04c997","type":"image","x":91.8508769110605,"y":85.57917248603351,"w":8,"h":14.42082751396648,"z":3,"imageAsset":"Butterfly-1.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/Butterfly-1.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100}],"background":""},{"id":"page-3","sourcePage":3,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Willow stopped and thought...\n\nWhere was everyone?\n\nThen the butterfly fluttered away.\n\nThe forest was very quiet!\n\n“Mommy? Mamma?” she called."],"imageAsset":"art-003.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-003.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-003.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-003.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"top","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-3-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.923265163432966,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-003.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-003.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-3-text","type":"text","x":57.396232856809604,"y":19.659962922217588,"w":35.815514589194756,"h":64.82802532116702,"z":2,"text":"Suddenly, Willow stopped and thought...\n\nWhere was everyone?\n\nThen the butterfly fluttered away.\n\nThe forest was very quiet!\n\n“Mommy? Mamma?” she called.","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"},{"id":"el-272e947e-8030-42fb-a6f2-f2911a80ef42","type":"image","x":46.28946315762085,"y":3.577592538190364,"w":8,"h":8,"z":3,"imageAsset":"Butterfly-1-3.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/Butterfly-1-3.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100}],"background":""},{"id":"page-4","sourcePage":4,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Then, suddenly...\n\nRustle, rustle. Crack!\n\nA big brown bear stepped out from behind a tree!\n\nWillow’s little knees began to wobble..."],"imageAsset":"art-004.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-004.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-004.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-004.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-4-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.96696381751442,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-004.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-004.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-4-text","type":"text","x":55.79438871015535,"y":16.992375482939064,"w":37.913760413661564,"h":72.20404957051585,"z":2,"text":"Then, suddenly...\n\nRustle, rustle. Crack!\n\nA big brown bear stepped out from behind a tree!\n\nWillow’s little knees began to wobble...","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""},{"id":"page-5","sourcePage":5,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Then, Willow did something she never had done before: \n\nShe planted her paws....\n\nThen she puffed out her chest.....\n\n“GRRRR-ROAR!” “GRRRR-ROAR!”\n\nOut came the biggest growl she had ever made!"],"imageAsset":"art-005.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-005.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-005.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-005.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-5-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.91306881081396,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-005.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-005.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-5-text","type":"text","x":56.149528808217994,"y":4.9040683761592785,"w":38.52512107297079,"h":85.99804401970871,"z":2,"text":"Then, Willow did something she never had done before: \n\nShe planted her paws....\n\nThen she puffed out her chest.....\n\n“GRRRR-ROAR!” “GRRRR-ROAR!”\n\nOut came the biggest growl she had ever made!","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""},{"id":"page-6","sourcePage":6,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["The bear jumped and turned and hurried away!\n\nOff Went the Bear!\n\nWillow had scared him off with one mighty growl.\n\n“Oh!” she whispered.\n\n“That was me?!”"],"imageAsset":"art-006.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-006.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-006.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-006.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-6-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.90869894540582,"h":99.53804347826087,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-006.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-006.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-6-text","type":"text","x":56.23568140767931,"y":17.49048913043478,"w":38.00582648721086,"h":69.07618400621118,"z":2,"text":"The bear jumped and turned and hurried away!\n\nOff Went the Bear!\n\nWillow had scared him off with one mighty growl.\n\n“Oh!” she whispered.\n\n“That was me?!”","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""},{"id":"page-7","sourcePage":7,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["After all that excitement, Willow crept into a soft, leafy bush.\n\nShe curled up small and waited.\n\n“I wish Mommy and Mamma were here.” she said quietly...\n(in case Mr Bear came back!)"],"imageAsset":"art-007.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-007.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-007.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-007.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-7-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.86791353492979,"h":99.61762422360249,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-007.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-007.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-7-text","type":"text","x":55.98834702557828,"y":24.569778726708073,"w":37.6655596340966,"h":52.43167701863354,"z":2,"text":"After all that excitement, Willow crept into a soft, leafy bush.\n\nShe curled up small and waited.\n\n“I wish Mommy and Mamma were here.” she said quietly...\n(in case Mr Bear came back!)","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""},{"id":"page-8","sourcePage":8,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Willow then heard what she thought was the most wonderful sound she had ever heard\n\nA familiar roar rolled through the trees.\n\n“WILLOW! WILLOW!”\n\nHer ears pricked up.\n\n“Mommy? Mamma?”"],"imageAsset":"art-008.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-008.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-008.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-008.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-8-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.74439200605955,"h":99.74136257763975,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-008.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-008.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-8-text","type":"text","x":57.784070383965506,"y":11.794642857142858,"w":34.726970809299075,"h":70.48631599378882,"z":2,"text":"Willow then heard what she thought was the most wonderful sound she had ever heard\n\nA familiar roar rolled through the trees.\n\n“WILLOW! WILLOW!”\n\nHer ears pricked up.\n\n“Mommy? Mamma?”","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"},{"id":"el-7085f1ca-f108-4422-a5c1-aa6e5c2fcbb8","type":"image","x":81.50060075618117,"y":84.30890129259694,"w":10.139243157442218,"h":15.691098707403055,"z":3,"imageAsset":"Moms-1-2.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/Moms-1-2.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100}],"background":""},{"id":"page-9","sourcePage":9,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["“I’m Here!” “I’m here!” \n\nWillow roared: “Over here!”\n\nMommy and Mamma came running.\n\nWillow burst out of the bushes and raced towards them."],"imageAsset":"art-009.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-009.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-009.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-009.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-9-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.82159296160345,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-009.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-009.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-9-text","type":"text","x":56.923206898560856,"y":20.130240683229815,"w":35.12608518324302,"h":57.368109472049696,"z":2,"text":"“I’m Here!” “I’m here!” \n\nWillow roared: “Over here!”\n\nMommy and Mamma came running.\n\nWillow burst out of the bushes and raced towards them.","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"},{"id":"el-a5e3f259-0e05-4aee-8349-1a2d0fe1c754","type":"image","x":88.94226126831204,"y":82.62292523501762,"w":11.057738731687959,"h":17.377074764982375,"z":3,"imageAsset":"Willow Talde-1.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/Willow%20Talde-1.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100}],"background":""},{"id":"page-10","sourcePage":10,"kind":"story","title":"WILLOW’S FOREST ADVENTURE","paragraphs":["Willow then got the biggest, happiest hug she could ever remember!\n\nMommy cuddled her and Mamma held them both close.\n\n“We found you, our precious Willow!”\n\nAnd in their warm, stripy hug, everything was right again."],"imageAsset":"art-010.webp","fullPageAsset":"art-010.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-010.webp?v=1790252477924","fullPageUrl":"/media/images/art-010.webp?v=1790252477924","position":"bottom","focalPoint":"50% 50%","elements":[{"id":"page-10-art","type":"image","x":0,"y":0,"w":48.96900308803822,"h":100,"z":1,"imageAsset":"art-010.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/art-010.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"page-10-text","type":"text","x":56.12701742119676,"y":16.674301242236027,"w":38,"h":64,"z":2,"text":"Willow then got the biggest, happiest hug she could ever remember!\n\nMommy cuddled her and Mamma held them both close.\n\n“We found you, our precious Willow!”\n\nAnd in their warm, stripy hug, everything was right again.","imageUrl":"","fontSize":4.6,"fontFamily":"","color":"","align":"left","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"body"}],"background":""}],"color":"honey","sortOrder":0,"hidden":false,"published":true,"audience":"children","pageTemplate":"one-up","characterRender":"scene","pageBackground":"#fefcdd","pageTexture":"felt","spreadBackground":"#bd9a61","textFont":"Quicksand","textColor":"#203b2a","titleLayout":{"elements":[{"id":"title-cover","type":"image","x":6.9682118467933485,"y":10.088220314318974,"w":34.824237307007124,"h":83.21231082654249,"z":1,"imageAsset":"Willow - Tiger.webp","imageUrl":"/media/images/Willow%20-%20Tiger.webp?v=1790252477924","fit":"cover","focusX":50,"focusY":50,"opacity":100},{"id":"title-title","type":"text","x":52.63279560378617,"y":17.873702292706206,"w":44.78627936269419,"h":30.085339369846878,"z":2,"text":"Willow’s Big \nForest Adventure","imageUrl":"","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":"Dancing Script","color":"","align":"center","frame":"","frameColor":"","role":"title"},{"id":"title-tagline","type":"text"